         memset(IPCB(skb), 0, sizeof(struct inet_skb_parm));
         return 0;
     }
     ```
   - If there are options, the code calculates the length of the options and calls `ip_options_compile` to compile the options:
     ```c
     opt->optlen = iph->ihl*4 - sizeof(struct iphdr);
